WEBVTT

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:20.880
<i>Once upon a time, long, long ago...</i>

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.590
<i>On the island of Comodo in a cave,</i> <i>where the sun never shone...</i>

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>The people lived their days,</i> <i>crushed in despair.</i>

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.360
<i>However, one day...</i>

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.000
<i>bathed in light, a goddess</i> <i>descended before the people.</i>

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.370
<i>People of Comodo, your time has</i> <i>come to be free from suffering.</i>

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.710
<i>Your days shall be filled with</i> <i>good fortune for eternity.</i>

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.850
<i>The people stopped working,</i> <i>as the goddess had said.</i>

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.680
<i>Some turned to drink, while</i> <i>others delighted in gambling,</i>

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.790
<i>and began to live for pleasure.</i>

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.790
<i>The people grew lazy and corrupt.</i>

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.260
<i>Unlike the town of Comodo,</i> <i>which was bathed in sunlight,</i>

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.260
<i>the people's hearts were</i> <i>being engulfed in darkness.</i>

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:12.100
<i>But some, who saw what had come</i> <i>to pass, rose up against it.</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.270
<i>That was when the goddess</i> <i>revealed her true form.</i>

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:21.680
<i>She was really a frightening witch.</i>

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:31.490
<i>The witch mercilessly rained fire</i> <i>down upon the people.</i>

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:36.020
<i>But the heroes never flinched,</i> <i>and after a hard-fought battle,</i>

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:38.860
<i>were able at last</i> <i>to seal in the witch.</i>

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:46.870
<i>The people who had been led astray</i> <i>repented, and peace came to Comodo.</i>

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.710
<i>And the people who wished</i> <i>to keep peace everlasting,</i>

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.880
<i>began a custom of shooting fireworks</i> <i>into the night skies over Comodo.</i>

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.040
<i>So that light would always</i> <i>shine upon the people's hearts.</i>

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.520
No matter how many times I hear it, it's a wonderful story.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.980
I'm happy to hear that.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:12.320
Binit!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.660
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.670
Very bad.

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.010
This has been Kapra Service's
Ragnarok lesson,

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.340
the Mystery of the Witch of Comodo.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.790
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.760
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.260
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:51.770
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:57.570
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.510
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.620
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:16.920
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:22.460
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:29.600
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:35.080
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.510
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:44.450
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.720
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.790
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.830
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:03.640
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.920
1, 2, 3...

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:22.790
4, 5, 6...

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.160
7...

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:32.500
Yuufa, what're you doing?

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.670
Building up my muscles.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:41.210
I lack physical strength, so I'm building up my muscles.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:45.010
So you want to be a Knight, like me?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.050
I'm not sure, yet.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:52.390
But someday, I'm going to make you say, "I need you" to me.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:56.060
Oh, my. But just don't forget this...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:05:00.760
My wish is to build a peaceful world where there is no war.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.290
Right!

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:18.850
Then come with me.
Our hearts are one.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.020
We're going to build a world of peace.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.620
Big Brother...

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.990
Yuufa... I need you!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.530
Brother...

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.260
Yuufa...

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.930
Yuufa! Yuufa!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.830
Hey! Yuufa, I said!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.770
How come you're in such a daze?!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.000
Judia-<i>san</i>?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.170
Look. We're out of the cave!

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.140
See?

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:48.340
You can see Comodo Town real good!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:12.800
<i>Comodo... What's going to happen here?</i>

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.850
If your hearts are apart,

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:02.980
traveling together will only bring unhappiness.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.820
Yuufa! Yuufa, I say!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.460
Huh? Oh. Wh-What?

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:11.830
Geez, what's wrong with you, anyway, Yuufa?

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:15.200
Huh? Oh. Ah...

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.930
Huh? No wonder you were acting strange!

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:22.940
If you were hungry, you should have said so!

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.410
Oh! Ha, ha, ha!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.710
Poring.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.310
Now that you mention it,
I smell something great.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.970
Poring.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.820
Oh, well.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.980
Let's go get something to eat.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.320
Mmm.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:46.630
Here, here. Bring more meat, I say!

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:47.460
Huh?

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.990
Meat! Bring meat!

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:55.600
Bring it on!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.840
You two are...

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:01.940
You guys are...

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.110
Huh? You know each other?

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:06.250
Yes, well...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.980
What the hell are you doing here?!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.590
My, oh my. It's Sonny Boy...

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:15.890
A Crusader, too.
What a success you've become.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.290
We thought you died at Izlude.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.390
Pretty impressive.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:23.200
What're you guys doing here?

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.270
Heh, heh. You mean us?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.630
We are now...

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.100
...Employed by this town.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.710
Employed?!

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.940
That's right!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.280
Our town of Comodo is where the Witch sleeps.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.410
Whenever she awakens...

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:40.010
Our heroes will protect us against her!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.350
H-Heroes?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.450
Oh! You just don't know anything, do you?

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:49.060
These people saved Morok from King Osiris.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.830
What's that?

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:55.400
Yes. And they defeated
Wolyafa of Payon!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.630
--Haah?!
--Poring?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:01.370
Well, that's why we're very busy now.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.300
Very busy.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.340
We can't very well refuse them, can we?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:05.710
We can't, can we?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.680
Just leave everything to us.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:13.810
If you people are ever in trouble, tell us, okay?

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:16.720
Now Comodo is safe.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.790
H-Hey, what're you talking about?!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.120
We saved Morok and Payon...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.560
Now, now...

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.830
Forget it, forget it.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.530
Do you want to tell them we're the ones who deserve the glory?

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.130
Forget that.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.670
But we're the ones who fought...

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.970
Why stir up trouble now?
It's only a pain.

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.610
But they've got to know the truth.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:44.310
Have you got some problem with those guys being the heroes?

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.180
But if this place should ever get attacked...

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:51.820
The townspeople were stupid to believe their lies.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.650
But...

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.020
Can't be helped.
Can't be helped.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.790
Never mind that.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.030
Let's have some meat. Meat!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.650
We need energy. Right, Iruga?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.990
Here you are!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.350
Ahh. This is too good!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.650
Welcome to the isle of fantasies, Comodo.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:26.450
Oh...

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:30.690
This island has a casino and other facilities which can only be found here.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.330
Please enjoy yourselves.

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.600
Huh, they've got a casino?

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.030
I'm itching for action!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.770
I'm gonna win us a free stay at the inn!

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:43.300
Iruga, we're staying in the honeymoon suite tonight!

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:46.040
We've got more important things to do...

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.540
Crud! Everybody's so selfish!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.180
Selfish...

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:57.120
What important things?!
Ain't you the sly one?

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.750
That's not what I mean!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.090
What, then? Tell me.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:01.660
--No, I mean...

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.560
--Whatever! Just shut up.
--No, I mean...

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.490
A beautiful memory of your mother?

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:46.370
My wish is to kill all human beings!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:52.370
I thought you'd forgotten your desire for revenge.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.000
Dammit!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.010
Great! Hit me again!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.150
Let's see!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.790
Huh?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.060
Joker?!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:43.020
Wha...

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.690
What's this?!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.700
A Monster in my casino?!

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.570
Good boy, Falco! Get 'em!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.310
Monsters outside, too!

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.970
Watch out! Monsters!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.690
Sir Heroes, please save us!

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.590
Please defend this town!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:20.900
Heh? Ow, ow. Oh, my side's starting to hurt!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.030
I wonder if it was that crab I ate!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:29.000
Oohhh... I've got a headache!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.170
My hip gout is acting up again.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:36.110
W-We can't fight like this. Sorry...

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:37.780
T-That's awful!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.550
They brought this on themselves.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.650
Poring.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.750
Be counting on you, Yuufa!

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.590
Let's go, Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.020
Monsters?

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:48.390
Could Big Brother have sent them?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.620
What's wrong, Big Sis?

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.190
Big Sis?

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:54.420
Big Sis! Where're you going?!

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.030
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.630
What's going on?!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:10.310
Charge Arrow!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.650
Double Strafing!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:17.640
That's dangerous, you-

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.990
Falco...

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:39.000
Dammit. Can't move!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.340
Iruga?

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.520
Venom...

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:55.680
Splasher...

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:06.830
You've got 10 seconds left to live.
No time for regrets anymore.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.360
Monsters!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.940
Run!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:12.640
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.680
<i>Where are you, Big Brother?!</i>

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.980
Big Sis! Wait, Big Sis!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:29.090
So we meet again...

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:30.390
You, again...

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.530
Poring!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.980
I'll be good to you, little girl.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.400
--Ugly, isn't it?
--Huh?

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.460
I resort to poison to survive...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.790
It's wretched and ugly.

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.230
No...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:13.770
It's not for my comrades.
I must live, even through the shame.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.740
For that day.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.100
That day?

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:21.300
That's right. Until I can reap the seed I've sown.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.780
His heart was pure... my friend.

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:30.850
My soul always returns there.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.480
To my friend, who shared good times with me.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:38.660
We gave everything to each other in trust.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:42.320
But Keough changed, and it was my fault.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:46.330
Keough...

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:52.670
My friend's soul changed, but I'll save him.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.340
I'll stake my life on it!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:03.280
Big Brother! Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.620
Where are you?
Big Brother Keough!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.950
Yuptel...

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.960
Holy... Cross!

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:34.980
It happened again.
Monsters all over the town!

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:51.970
Jirtas... You can't let it go, after all?

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.370
It's fine.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.670
It's fine that way, Jirtas.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:03.680
She glares at me. How sweet.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.750
Resist all you want, but you're still a human child.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.020
You could never beat us Monsters.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.290
I've grown tired of playing with you.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:17.950
I'll send you and this town to the other world.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:22.950
Then you won't be lonely, will you?

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.230
Who's the lonely one?!

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.330
What?

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.340
People were mean to you, so you joined the Monsters' world.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:33.840
But the emptiness in your heart is still there!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:34.980
It's only natural.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.310
You've only been running away!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.720
Say something, why don't you?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.390
You dirty...

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.980
Impudent!

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:56.000
This... doesn't hurt.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:01.140
Not when you compare it to the hurt in my heart!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.930
Or to your mother's agony!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:10.610
To live is to be hurt.
No one can run from it!

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:14.720
I'm not a Human! I'm a Monster!
I don't get hurt!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:17.120
Monsters, Humans... all the same, I say!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.890
You're just using the
Monsters as a place to run to!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.090
Shut up!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.960
But I have no place to run-

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.790
Shut up!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.760
That's why I just lived, with everything I could!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:28.960
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
I'm... I'm...

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.450
A Monster!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.630
Poring.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.210
You rejected Humans.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:44.650
That's why Humans rejected you.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.660
No! I'm not like Humans!

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.000
Wait a minute!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.500
Poring!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.660
Jirtas!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.240
We can't get the honeymoon suite.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.650
I'm sorry... Iruga.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.520
I'm sorry, Judia.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.350
For making you stay with me...

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.840
I can't keep doing this!

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:50.180
Go to Comodo, the fantasy isle of eternal night.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.010
You will find what you must know.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:55.040
But what must I know?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:06.190
You must not throw your life away.

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:10.260
It is not courage to face a foe you cannot defeat.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.030
It is folly.

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:14.330
But I have to...

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.640
<i>But I put all my strength into it...</i>

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.980
Strength alone isn't everything in this world.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:29.920
<i>So... So what should I do, then?</i>

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:34.510
Those who rely on strength alone are someday crushed by it.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.700
<i>Big Brother! Big Brother Keough!</i>

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way to</i> <i>regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:33.340
<i>This is Teiling.</i>

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:35.980
<i>Roan finally knows</i> <i>the true meaning of strength.</i>

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:38.250
<i>But where is Yuufa?</i>

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:41.080
<i>And what will happen</i> <i>to Maaya and Jirtas?</i>

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:45.680
<i>Next time,</i> "Good-bye."
<i>Should you be saying that?</i>
